<title>JAPAN: Daido Concrete - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Daido Concrete - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 11.36		vs	   10.03</p>
<p> Operating	  307    million    vs	   49    million</p>
<p> Current	  prft 200 million    vs    loss 46    million</p>
<p> Net		prft 121 million    vs    loss 80    million</p>
<p> EPS	     prft 5.07 yen	  vs     loss 3.35 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     24 million	  vs	  24 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Daido Concrete Co Ltd is a pile maker.</p>
</text>
